Account proxy pool implementation:
- Added proxy_pool account extra parsing, validation, stable account/proxy slot IDs, and effective capacity.
- Added independent Redis concurrency acquisition and waiting per account/proxy pair.
- Added admin create/update DTO fields and account response pool entries with current concurrency.
- Added create/edit proxy pool controls and account-list capacity badges.
- Added per-proxy capacity badges in the account capacity column, with live current/max values and proxy-name tooltips.
- Added a map-pin icon before each proxy name and concurrency value to distinguish proxy slots from account capacity.
- Ordered proxy-slot acquisition by live current/capacity ratio so traffic spreads across available IPs instead of exhausting the first configured IP.
- Added AccountCapacityCell regression coverage for aggregate and per-proxy concurrency rendering.
- Added proxy-key based backup export/import conversion for proxy pools.
